        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "The application uses JWT tokens for authentication but decodes them without verifying the signature. This allows attackers to create forged tokens with arbitrary content. The vulnerability is in api.py at line 41 where jwt.decode() is called without specifying algorithms parameter, allowing signature verification to be bypassed."
        },
        {
          "name": "pqs:occurrences",
          "value": "1"
        },
